    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're lost in a vast forest \u2014 but your partner is firing flares to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert \u2014 it\u2019s easy to get lost in the vast woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face many challenges \u2014 the cold and the Wendigo are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire is your only friend \u2014 and the Wendigo's enemy. But unfortunately, it doesn\u2019t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your torch is out, loot matches to reignite campfires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires not only keep you warm \u2014 they reignite your torch and your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the torch goes out, stay quiet\u2026 or he'll hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too long without heat, and the cold kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes (or longer, if survival proves difficult).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is slightly different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (English).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reacts to real-life microphone input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May contain jumpscares.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're lost in a vast forest \u2014 but your partner is firing flares to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert \u2014 it\u2019s easy to get lost in the vast woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face many challenges \u2014 the cold and the Wendigo are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire is your only friend \u2014 and the Wendigo's enemy. But unfortunately, it doesn\u2019t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your torch is out, loot matches to reignite campfires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires not only keep you warm \u2014 they reignite your torch and your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the torch goes out, stay quiet\u2026 or he'll hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too long without heat, and the cold kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes (or longer, if survival proves difficult).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is slightly different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (English).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reacts to real-life microphone input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May contain jumpscares.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hardcore horror experience where you must seek heat to survive the cold and confront a stalking Wendigo. Escape the forest by following flares, searching for campsites, looting matches, lighting fires, and being stealthy when needed.",
